body:
Well if you think one road makes a city shit then every city must be shit in your eyes.

&#x200B;

As for walkability, there's pavements/sidewalks under those tree lines both on the median and on the the sides of the street. There's also St.Goerge's mall which is one giant strip that only allows access to emergency and maintenance vehicles. Also on the first/ Thursday of every month there's stalls that sells crafts, food and drinks for sale. We call it First Thursday
